  "description": "Grand Touring In Aluminum Excellence.\nColor: Fog | Molten\n\nTake off and go the distance in our most comfortable trike yet. The GTS (Gran Tourismo Sport) perfectly meshes comfort with performance, giving riders a sporting experience.\n\nA solid 7000 series aluminum frame creates a lightweight ride which dampens vibration, adding to your comfort. The frame also features a rear triangle design, made to make every pedal stroke as efficient as possible. A new larger boom also enhances stiffness, giving a solid-feeling ride.\n\nPrecision control is at your fingertips with hydraulic brakes, while trail-commanding deep profile rims and Schwalbe Tryker tires push you forward.\n\nRide for hours in the new Sport Touring seat, constructed from a light breathable mesh to keep you cool and comfortable. The seat also features an adjustable mid-back section for personalized comfort. The seat is attached using the new Wishbone seat stay design, built to improve stability and handling.",
